{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d25fb2ce2230f10d","name":"Spring-Loaded Mechanism","source":{"id":"source:reference-d25fb2ce2230f10d","title":"Spring-Loaded Mechanism","revision":18523,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:15:33Z","sha256":"4f193d826041fd9ceec5ebf9821d3c5344ef646c7e9c6645695e493f7a463709","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18523","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Spring-Loaded%20Mechanism&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d25fb2ce2230f10d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 150\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 3 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This device allows a Small, Medium, or Large Droid (Spring-Loaded Mechanisms are not typically designed (or practical) for Droids of Huge or larger size\n) to launch an item held in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Compartment Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Compartment_Space","referenceId":"reference:ac94b2e9b2d1d3e2"}," up to 8 meters as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The item can weigh no more than 4 kg, and the Droid makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10 to launch the projectile into a designated square. Anyone within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," of the target square who has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Readied Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Readied_Action"}," can try to catch the item, provided the Droid's attack succeeds. (If the attack fails, the item lands in a randomly determined square adjacent to the target square.) Catching the item requires a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," check and is considered a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
